title: Box3B
---
// Talk target of the moving box in 3B (Interact layer). See drawers_3b.yarn.
-> Look
    <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "box">>
        You: Under the cables. Where I put them so I'd stop seeing them.
        <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
        <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
    <<else>>
        You: Cables. Chargers for phones I don't own anymore.
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "box">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "on">>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Take the blush socks <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "box">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to true>>
===
